    "body": "The hamster emoji is used by the golang module. Are any of the [conditions](https://starship.rs/config/#go) for displaying it met? You can use the `detect_` options to tweak the conditions or disable if you don't want to see it. You can use `starship explain` to get an overview of what each prompt segment means.\r\n\r\n",
